    "text": "Capacitors in series\r\n\\(2 C_{1} \\times V_{1}=C \\times V_{2}\\)\r\n\\(2 V_{1}=V_{2} \\ldots\\) (i)\r\nand \\(V_{1}+V_{2}+V_{1}=60 \\ldots\\) (ii)\r\nSolving Eqs. (i) and (ii), we get\r\n\\(V_{2}=30 \\mathrm{~V}\\)",
